"click on the Flight Plan map, and select Rally Points > Set Rally Point on "
"the resulting pop-up menu (note that this ONLY work in the Flight Plan "
"screen, not the Flight Data screen):"
msgstr ""
"集结点的纬度和经度。要设置集结点位置，在飞行计划地图上右键点击，在弹出菜单中选择「Rally Points」>「Set Rally "
"Point」（注意这只能在飞行计划界面中操作，飞行数据界面不可用）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:46
#: 02efd0bd650b4ea1832423ebab149978 5223ebb270dd4c3990a86cef2aa196f7
#: 62dc7ebed9034e4d993a437333f916af 8458cbe07d0147659c25382e08c12886
#: e16419faa36c4a23b3e7e103c61eb2aa ee2ff3e6415042f7aa065b90bc2ae157
