"The Rally loiter altitudes need to be specified (note that the default "
"altitude for Rally Points is the default waypoint altitude value and is "
"relative to the home location):"
msgstr "需要指定集结点的盘旋高度（注意集结点的默认高度是默认航点高度值，相对于 Home 位置）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:56
